<SiteLayout title="About the Independent Communications & Creative Studio" description="The Odd Phoenix is an independent strategic communications and creative-services company bringing strategy, storytelling, and design together."><PageHeader eyebrow="A little perspective" title="Less fluff. More substance." description="Good work starts with understanding what you’re trying to say—and who needs to hear it."/><section class="about-body texture"><div class="wrap prose-grid"><h2>Thoughtful work.<br/><em>Human approach.</em></h2><div><p class="editorial large-copy">The Odd Phoenix is an independent strategic communications and creative-services company.</p><p>We connect strategy, writing, design, and digital work around your goals. That might mean sharpening a message, building a brand, launching a shop, or bringing the moving parts of a project together.</p><p>You work directly with an independent studio. We listen, define the scope together, and keep communication clear through delivery.</p><p>You don’t need a polished brief. A question, a challenge, or a slightly unusual idea is a perfectly good place to start.</p><a class="button ink" href={base+'contact/'}>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section><ProjectProcess/>
